<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1611003" svcinfotypenbr = "03" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Cooling Fan Operation Description
</title>
<ptxt>
Cooling fan operates for up to 120 seconds if coolant temperature is higher than predetermined level even when the engine is not running.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Radiator cooling fan motor is controlled by ECM as follows.
</ptxt>
<figure>
